        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú inósuú kilá', kudá' atén ti waydií hanimiís, inós kuungá' nu hhoohhooeesi kángw kilá' wa ale. Nee slám inós munerhúng nee qeeremoohúng nee slaqoohúng ngi xun as gár tlaakw munduwa sleér, ala kuungá' masók a múk xaslxaansli wásl ay bál Aakoorén Yesu Kristo nay hardihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inósuudá' kuungá' nu ateetiím i inkihhimuú kón, nee inós adoorí ga tleehh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
